{"id": "JAH-SIG-KNOWLEDG-000002", "slug": "tool-knowledge-base-manager-signature", "title": "Knowledge Base Manager \u2014 Input and output contract", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "tool database record", "ladder_rank": 3, "body": "Signature edition. Original Signature methods and framings developed for the JAH system, labeled Signature throughout. Inputs: Knowledge items, queries. Outputs: Stored entries; retrieved excerpts with sources.", "capabilities": ["Structured knowledge entries with provenance", "Deduplication on write", "Related-entry linking", "Precise excerpt retrieval", "Staleness tracking per entry"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Input/output contract validation", "code": "const q={query:'zip permissions',count:5};const ok=typeof q.query==='string'&&q.count>0&&q.count<=50;J({query:q.query,valid:!!ok});assert(ok,'contract');", "verified_output": "{\"query\":\"zip permissions\",\"valid\":true}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "catalog-100-basic-pc-ai-tools-2026-10-21.txt", "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Knowledge Base Manager Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Encyclopedia Lookup", "Source Citation Tool", "Plugin and Tool Registry"], "sibling_edition": "tool-knowledge-base-manager"}}
{"id": "JAH-SIG-KNOWLEDG-000003", "slug": "tool-knowledge-base-manager-signature", "title": "Knowledge Base Manager \u2014 Core capabilities", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "tool database record", "ladder_rank": 5, "body": "Signature edition. Original Signature methods and framings developed for the JAH system, labeled Signature throughout. Capabilities: Structured knowledge entries with provenance; Deduplication on write; Related-entry linking; Precise excerpt retrieval; Staleness tracking per entry.", "capabilities": ["Structured knowledge entries with provenance", "Deduplication on write", "Related-entry linking", "Precise excerpt retrieval", "Staleness tracking per entry"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Core operation executed", "code": "const docs=[{id:1,text:'zip archives store permissions in external attributes'},{id:2,text:'tar preserves unix permissions'},{id:3,text:'png images use lossless compression'}];const q='permissions';const hits=docs.filter(d=>d.text.includes(q)).map(d=>d.id);J({query:q,hits});assert(JSON.stringify(hits)==='[1,2]','search');", "verified_output": "{\"query\":\"permissions\",\"hits\":[1,2]}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "catalog-100-basic-pc-ai-tools-2026-10-21.txt", "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Knowledge Base Manager Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Encyclopedia Lookup", "Source Citation Tool", "Plugin and Tool Registry"], "sibling_edition": "tool-knowledge-base-manager"}}
{"id": "JAH-SIG-KNOWLEDG-000004", "slug": "tool-knowledge-base-manager-signature", "title": "Knowledge Base Manager \u2014 Worked example", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "tool database record", "ladder_rank": 7, "body": "Signature edition. Original Signature methods and framings developed for the JAH system, labeled Signature throughout. Store 20 procedures with sources, then answer 'how do we back up the database?' with the exact stored excerpt and its source.", "capabilities": ["Structured knowledge entries with provenance", "Deduplication on write", "Related-entry linking", "Precise excerpt retrieval", "Staleness tracking per entry"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Worked example end to end", "code": "const rows=[['tool','kind'],['reader','file'],['parser','document']];const csv=rows.map(r=>r.map(c=>'\"'+c.replace(/\"/g,'\"\"')+'\"').join(',')).join('\\n');const back=csv.split('\\n').map(l=>l.split(',').map(c=>c.replace(/^\"|\"$/g,'')));J({rows:back.length,roundtrip:JSON.stringify(back)===JSON.stringify(rows)});assert(back.length===3,'csv');", "verified_output": "{\"rows\":3,\"roundtrip\":true}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "catalog-100-basic-pc-ai-tools-2026-10-21.txt", "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Knowledge Base Manager Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Encyclopedia Lookup", "Source Citation Tool", "Plugin and Tool Registry"], "sibling_edition": "tool-knowledge-base-manager"}}
{"id": "JAH-SIG-KNOWLEDG-000005", "slug": "tool-knowledge-base-manager-signature", "title": "Knowledge Base Manager \u2014 Safety, limits, and failure modes", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "tool database record", "ladder_rank": 9, "body": "Signature edition. Original Signature methods and framings developed for the JAH system, labeled Signature throughout. Stores what it is given \u2014 garbage in, garbage out; stale entries are flagged by age, not auto-corrected.", "capabilities": ["Structured knowledge entries with provenance", "Deduplication on write", "Related-entry linking", "Precise excerpt retrieval", "Staleness tracking per entry"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Safety limits enforced", "code": "const ROBOTS={'example.com':['/private']};function fetchable(url){const u=new URL(url);return !(ROBOTS[u.hostname]||[]).some(p=>u.pathname.startsWith(p));}J({url:'https://example.com/private/x',fetchable:fetchable('https://example.com/private/x')});assert(!fetchable('https://example.com/private/x'),'robots');", "verified_output": "{\"url\":\"https://example.com/private/x\",\"fetchable\":false}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "catalog-100-basic-pc-ai-tools-2026-10-21.txt", "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Knowledge Base Manager Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Encyclopedia Lookup", "Source Citation Tool", "Plugin and Tool Registry"], "sibling_edition": "tool-knowledge-base-manager"}}
